$('jsonInput').onchange=async e=>{const f=e.target.files[0];if(!f)return;try{const binary=/\.koib$/i.test(f.name);if(!binary&&f.size>window.KoiStorage.BUFFERED_IMPORT_LIMIT)throw Error('JSON 備份過大；請使用 .koib 串流專案備份');const p=binary?await window.KoiBackup.readProjectBackup(f,{maxProjectBytes:window.KoiStorage.projectWriteLimit(project)}):JSON.parse(await f.text());if(typeof p.title!=='string'||!Array.isArray(p.chapters)||!p.chapters.length||p.chapters.some(c=>typeof c.title!=='string'||!Array.isArray(c.events)||c.events.some(v=>!Object.hasOwn(kinds,v.type)||typeof v.text!=='string'||(v.type==='choice'&&(!Array.isArray(v.options)||v.options.some(o=>typeof o.text!=='string'||(o.target!==null&&!Number.isInteger(o.target))))))))throw Error();p.images=binary?(p.images||[]):Array.isArray(p.images)?p.images.filter(x=>typeof x.id==='string'&&typeof x.name==='string'&&/^data:image\/(png|jpeg|webp|gif|avif|bmp);base64,/.test(x.data)):[];window.KoiStorage.assertWritableProjectSize(await window.KoiStorage.usage(p),p);for(const a of [...p.images,...p.audio||[],...p.videos||[],...p.fonts||[]]){const blob=await window.KoiStorage.blobOf(a);a.data=window.KoiStorage.objectURL(blob);a.bytes=blob.size}snapshot();project=p;projectReady=true;chapter=0;selected=0;stop();dirty();render();renderAssets();toast('專案匯入完成')}catch(err){toast(err.message||'無法讀取，請選擇本製作器匯出的 JSON 或 .koib 專案')}e.target.value=''};
